{"id":"3f3a64210eb0d1ae0d585116d9d527b8df19da57","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237343","title":"我找到了一个机器人消息通知到微信的方法","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"zhangduxiu","excerpt":"分享创造 - @zhangduxiu - 1.企业微信建立一个企业 不用认证2.企微后台->我的企业->微信插件3.扫码关注后在微信里面建立群 不需要加企微里面的同事4.企微里面会出现你新建立的群 在这个群里面加机器人就行了","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/zhangduxiu\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/efc1a7c03b64cdf6ec39d14208edae00?s=73&d=retro\" alt=\"zhangduxiu\" data-uid=\"681622\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    <h2>我找到了一个机器人消息通知到微信的方法</h2>\n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/zhangduxiu\">zhangduxiu</a> · <span title=\"2026-08-26 13:58:18 +08:00\">21h 18m ago</span> · 3206 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>1.企业微信建立一个企业 不用认证<br>2.企微后台-&gt;我的企业-&gt;微信插件<br>3.扫码关注后在微信里面建立群 不需要加企微里面的同事<br>4.企微里面会出现你新建立的群 在这个群里面加机器人就行了</p><p>机器人消息只能是 text 类型 其他类型微信上提示不支持此类消息</p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/机器人\"><li></li> 机器人</a><a href=\"/tag/微信\"><li></li> 微信</a><a href=\"/tag/通知\"><li></li> 通知</a></P><p><span>44 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-27 11:13:15 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020046\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fe8d0fbd6a1f5c1cc2d4faf0146a3ef3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"liangqun\" data-uid=\"108840\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/liangqun\">liangqun</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 14:47:58 +08:00\">20h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>3.扫码关注后在微信里面建立群</p><p>这一步卡住了，不知道如何操作，还请指教</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020131\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/efc1a7c03b64cdf6ec39d14208edae00?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zhangduxiu\" data-uid=\"681622\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhangduxiu\">zhangduxiu</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 15:03:53 +08:00\">20h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/fsj036a.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fsj036a.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p><p>扫码关注后在手机微信上会出现一个聊天消息 点进去 <br>然后右上角发起会话  选择你自己 确定后会进入聊天页面 右上角在点击添加成员还选择你自己 群就建立出来了</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020155\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4920/a5db/591875_normal.png?m=1782877123\" alt=\"burden7\" data-uid=\"591875\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/burden7\">burden7</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 15:07:58 +08:00\">20h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>具体场景呢？</p><p>微信的 clawbot 是不是也可以满足需求？</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020168\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7470/67d9/486597_normal.png?m=1759675476\" alt=\"hay0577\" data-uid=\"486597\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hay0577\">hay0577</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 15:10:28 +08:00\">20h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/burden7\">burden7</a>  微信的 clawbot  token 有时效 经常半夜的定时任务信息不会发布过来 。需要手动聊一下激活一下才行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020187\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/efc1a7c03b64cdf6ec39d14208edae00?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zhangduxiu\" data-uid=\"681622\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhangduxiu\">zhangduxiu</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 15:14:05 +08:00\">20h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/burden7\">burden7</a> 上面说的对  24 小时内需要回复消息才能保活 这种方式是把企微的内部群接入到微信  企微内部群还可以一起添加多个机器人 还能互动 多好啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020193\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/34ac/07b5/350009_normal.png?m=1615174451\" alt=\"dream10201\" data-uid=\"350009\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dream10201\">dream10201</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 15:15:09 +08:00\">20h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用了不知道多少年了，发现了自己偷摸用，公布出来估计就离 GG 不远了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020233\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ee2c/e2b6/27030_normal.png?m=1782377505\" alt=\"sm1314\" data-uid=\"27030\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sm1314\">sm1314</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 15:19:24 +08:00\">19h 57m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>简单一句话：拉普通微信用户到企业群用企微机器人通知</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020295\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7c517e564b03273737f37b4e9bc620d6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ThirdFlame\" data-uid=\"83346\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ThirdFlame\">ThirdFlame</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 15:27:03 +08:00\">19h 49m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/nightlight9\">nightlight9</a> #10 是指在微信 app 里面 可以收发企业微信群信息（以企业微信的账号）。 也就变相实现了通过企业微信的群机器人 通知信息到普通微信的功能（虽然显示在普通微信中的企业微信中，但是总不用开企业微信 app 了）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020318\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bbcc/330f/58083_normal.png?m=1773993307\" alt=\"boneyao\" data-uid=\"58083\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/boneyao\">boneyao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 15:30:55 +08:00\">19h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是不是版本啊。我现在还没有成功，最后拉自己没有成功</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020347\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aa78/6a17/447415_normal.png?m=1747382320\" alt=\"git00ll\" data-uid=\"447415\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/git00ll\">git00ll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 15:36:03 +08:00\">19h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>能发布到普通微信中吗， 是否手机上还要登陆企业微信</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020366\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7940/6661/516931_normal.png?m=1735634778\" alt=\"nonewind\" data-uid=\"516931\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nonewind\">nonewind</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 15:40:50 +08:00\">19h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/git00ll\">git00ll</a> 可以发送到 普通微信中，需要在企业微信的后台-[我的企业]-[微信插件]里有个[邀请关注]，扫描这个二维码才可以；我实际测试下来的结果；</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020384\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/794926bf22737a9fb44b6fce34ff5ae4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xinyana\" data-uid=\"452778\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xinyana\">xinyana</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 15:42:46 +08:00\">19h 33m ago via Android</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>群机器人有 webhook</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020680\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d6aa/de52/365062_normal.png?m=1786320313\" alt=\"HuberyPang\" data-uid=\"365062\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/HuberyPang\">HuberyPang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 16:35:43 +08:00\">18h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>测试了 如果想要别人方便的接收消息 需要别人加入创建的企业，然后在加入群聊 微信端限制只能展示 text 类型 其他类型需要到企微上看，是个路子但是也有不少局限性</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020699\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6e37716a1ab99aea3f392289c4d9b6bc?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Leez088\" data-uid=\"399434\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Leez088\">Leez088</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 16:39:03 +08:00\">18h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>试了下确实可以，可惜的是只能看 text 信息，我这边有些推送服务信息格式没法改，还是得留着企业微信 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020752\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/54f5/c289/180379_normal.png?m=1593680854\" alt=\"cgygd\" data-uid=\"180379\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cgygd\">cgygd</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 16:47:34 +08:00\">18h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>谢谢，之前一直没找到合适的方案。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020776\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3c06/f7fd/695146_normal.png?m=1786592794\" alt=\"crazykun\" data-uid=\"695146\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/crazykun\">crazykun</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 16:52:11 +08:00\">18h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>弄个企业, 添加点域名邮箱倒是挺好用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18020902\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ccb21acafc718fa957601